/--
Function-body soundness for terminal callee exits.

When imported Yul function-body execution exits through `YulHalt` or `Revert`,
the recursive body theorem yields a source `Outcome.halt`.  This adapter turns
that scoped body outcome into the actual `FunDef.runBody = halted ...` result
used by source user-call statements.
-/
theorem sourceFunDef_runBody_halted_of_bodySound_error
