/--
Selected-path result relation for the generated inner `runForLoop`
continuation.

Unlike `SourceOpenStmtHeadPathDoneRel`, this relation has no target context:
`runForLoop` is already inside the generated loop and returns only an outcome.
The outer statement shell is responsible for restricting a final regular state
back to the caller scope.
-/
