/--
Path contract for a recursive source loop continuation matched directly by the
compiler-open generated `runForLoop`.

This is the boundary needed after a loop body and post block both complete
normally.  It deliberately avoids the outer `Stmt.run` wrapper, so recursive
loop preservation can feed the continuation straight into the generated
`for true` shell.
