/--
No-user-call checked regular argument-prelude bundle.

This is the local, derivable sibling of
`SourceArgListPreludeRegularAllCheckedAt`: generated argument lists must carry
syntactic evidence that they contain no internal Yul user-function calls.  That
extra premise is exactly what lets no-CALL/no-user routes avoid the global
expression-result hook while preserving the ordinary checked scoping and arity
surface.
-/
