/--
Compile-fuel-parametric result sequence constructor for singleton regular
heads.

The recursive bridge wants to quantify over whatever list-lowering fuel the
caller selected.  This wrapper makes the low-fuel impossible cases explicit and
keeps the real composition behind the existing exact cons theorem.
