  · intro reserved layout outcomeLayout ctx sourceStmts allowed canBreak
      canContinue canLeave hSafe hScoped hStmtsOk hSourceScoped hAllowed hCompat
      hScope
    exact hBridge.block hSafe hScoped hStmtsOk hSourceScoped hAllowed hCompat
      hFuel hScope
  · intro reserved layout outcomeLayout ctx compileFuel sourceStmts allowed
      canBreak canContinue canLeave hSafe hScoped hStmtsOk hSourceScoped
      hAllowed hCompat hScopeContains
    exact
      hBridge.hiddenBlock hSafe hScoped hStmtsOk hSourceScoped hAllowed
        hCompat hFuel hScopeContains
  · intro reserved layout outcomeLayout ctx compileFuel sourceStmts canBreak
      canContinue canLeave hSafe hScoped hStmtsOk hSourceScoped hHandlers
      hScopeContains
    exact
      hBridge.hiddenModeBlock hSafe hScoped hStmtsOk hSourceScoped hHandlers
        hFuel hScopeContains
  · intro reserved layout
    exact hBridge.args hFuel

