  exact ⟨sourceResult, sourceOutcome, targetFuel, hSource, hCompiler, hRel⟩

/--
Run-filtered checked root-dispatcher lowering target at the exact-domain
boundary.

This is the dispatcher-facing adapter for the exact recursive bridge.  It is
still checked against the actual `Stmt.toFunctionsList?` dispatcher lowering,
but the resulting body theorem expects `SourceStateExactRel` at the root.
