/--
Fuel-bounded checked generated-argument regularity.

This is the checked sibling of
`sourceArgListPreludeRegularAt_of_lowerBound1?_exprEvalSound_scoped_covers_bounded`.
It threads source safety and user-call arity to each generated head expression,
which is required by the recursive regular expression dispatcher.
