Non-recursive generated-loop branches from hidden-scope body/post block
contracts.

The post-regular recursive branch is intentionally not included here: selecting
regular vs nonregular recursive continuation depends on the post-state exposed
by the post block proof, so it belongs in a separate continuation constructor.
